&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FREENOW:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Freenow by Lyft empowers smarter mobility decisions, helping people to move freely and cities to thrive. Through our multi-mobility app, we feature broad options for everyone across 9 European markets and over 180 cities. Millions of passengers can access services including taxis, private hire vehicles, carsharing, car rental, e-scooters, e-bikes, e-mopeds, and public transport within a single app.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In July 2025 Freenow was acquired by Lyft, a global mobility platform, which connects riders and drivers for billions of rides across North America and Europe. Together, Freenow and Lyft are creating a more caring and connected world, with transportation for everyone. We are a global, diverse, highly motivated, and collaborative team that strives for excellence and likes to have fun. Ready for your next ride?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.de/%C3%9Cberblick/Arbeit-bei-FREE-NOW-EI_IE954578.11,19.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt6e28a7086c72dd55/bltadef6ed7354e9cc4/65a10957984e23040a418da6/glassdoor-logotype-rgb_2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;150&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kununu.com/de/mytaxi-intelligent-apps&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt6e28a7086c72dd55/blte53af231aaa0c840/65a109382311a30407ba07ce/kununu_logo_black_2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;150&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/free-now/life/2b1603ea-741a-49f8-9847-f1214f483a1a/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://brand.linkedin.com/content/dam/me/business/en-us/amp/brand-site/v2/bg/LI-Logo.svg.original.svg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;143&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI coding is the largest use case of enterprise AI adoption today, as is evident from the success of Anthropic on Claude Code, Cursor’s $60B exit to SpaceX, and Cognition’s $48B valuation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The bottleneck now has moved from code generation to security and safety - AI agents write code faster than any team can review it, and over 65% of the lines of code produced by them are insecure. Vulnerabilities are piling up 16x faster than companies can fix them, and adversaries are able to exploit these new vulnerabilities within hours.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;AURI by Endor Labs closes that gap. It runs inside the harness where coding agents work, through hooks, skills and MCP, so the controls sit outside the model and every agent action is visible. Underneath is our patented code context graph, which maps code, open source, containers and infrastructure. It shows which vulnerabilities can actually be reached and exploited, then delivers fixes that won’t break the application. Security teams get evidence instead of noise, and developers get fixes instead of tickets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The companies building AI trust us to secure it - our customers include OpenAI, SpaceX, DoorDash, Dropbox, Atlassian, MongoDB, Snowflake, Robinhood and Peloton to name a few.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Endor Labs is the third company from Founder &amp;amp; CEO Varun Badhwar, who built Prisma Cloud, the platform that helped define cloud security, from $0 to $300M ARR at Palo Alto Networks. We’ve raised $163M from Lightspeed, Coatue, DFJ Growth, Salesforce Ventures and Dell Technologies Capital.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Software runs everything around our lives today - banking, hospitals, airports and power grids. AI now writes more of it every day, and our mission is to make sure the world can trust that software. Come build that future with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;How-You’ll-Make-an-Impact&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;876&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;How You’ll Make an Impact&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Solutions Architect at Endor Labs, you&#39;re at the heart of connecting our innovative team with our diverse and dynamic customers. Every day presents a new set of exciting challenges and opportunities to make a significant impact:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educate with Enthusiasm:&lt;/strong&gt; Elevate awareness about Application Security and Software Supply Chain Security. It&#39;s about making security engaging and accessible to developers everywhere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master Our Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep dive into our supply chain security product suite and emerge as the go-to expert and evangelist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Tailored Demos:&lt;/strong&gt; Showcase our solutions in a way that speaks directly to the needs and challenges of our customers. Be the architect of captivating, solution-oriented presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape Customer Outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with our engineering and product teams to design solutions that genuinely address customer challenges. Your insights from the field will directly influence our product development, ensuring we always meet our customers&#39; evolving needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilitate Customer Success:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide customers through onboarding, ensuring a smooth transition and adoption of the Endor Labs solution. Your goal is to empower customers to leverage our technology fully and ensure they achieve their security and development objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring to the Table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on the hunt for someone who is not just looking for a job but likes a bit of adventure, too! You&#39;ll fit right in if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;poqw43&quot; data-start=&quot;297&quot; data-end=&quot;491&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Rich Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have experience in pre-sales or a similar customer-facing, technical role. You&#39;re no stranger to technical deep dives, product demonstrations, and leading evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hrgdhb&quot; data-start=&quot;493&quot; data-end=&quot;841&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;495&quot; data-end=&quot;527&quot;&gt;Strong Technical Foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; A solid understanding of modern software development practices, including backend or full-stack development experience, CI/CD pipelines, Git-based development workflows, and DevOps tooling. You’re comfortable engaging deeply with engineering teams and understanding how modern applications are built and deployed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;44alsd&quot; data-start=&quot;843&quot; data-end=&quot;1108&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;845&quot; data-end=&quot;880&quot;&gt;Application Security Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with application security concepts, software supply chain security, and/or identity &amp;amp; access management principles. You understand the importance of securing developer workflows and modern cloud-native environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xiq5d5&quot; data-start=&quot;1110&quot; data-end=&quot;1310&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1112&quot; data-end=&quot;1127&quot;&gt;Tech Savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; A robust understanding of the Developer, DevOps, Application Security, and open-source ecosystems. Hopefully, you can meet developers where they are and flex some programming skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;otuo74&quot; data-start=&quot;1312&quot; data-end=&quot;1493&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1314&quot; data-end=&quot;1342&quot;&gt;Customer &amp;amp; Sales Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve successfully engaged with technical customers at an Enterprise level and know how to articulate complex solutions and operate in a sales cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;roopa0&quot; data-start=&quot;1495&quot; data-end=&quot;1625&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1497&quot; data-end=&quot;1528&quot;&gt;Curious and Eager to Learn:&lt;/strong&gt; Always on the lookout for new technologies and understanding the intricacies of how things work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12ecp9k&quot; data-start=&quot;1627&quot; data-end=&quot;1739&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1629&quot; data-end=&quot;1654&quot;&gt;Collaborative Spirit:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in a team setting and value diversity and inclusion in every interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;25v10y&quot; data-start=&quot;1741&quot; data-end=&quot;1840&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1743&quot; data-end=&quot;1763&quot;&gt;Action-oriented:&lt;/strong&gt; You prefer actively solving customer problems and asking for help as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes Us... Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go to extraordinary lengths to distinguish ourselves through world-class work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize quality over speed, and speed over scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to work with deeply kind, mission-driven people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strive to make the complex simple.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use first principles to debate ideas, test assumptions, and make decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek the truth by putting data above opinions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assume good intent and give tactical feedback to help each other get better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold no ego—when our customers win, we all win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and comprehensive benefits package including Health, Dental, Vision and Mental Health plans.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) plan to support your longterm financial goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO to maintain a healthy work-life balance (we want you here for the long-haul!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for co-working and team meetups to foster collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office environment for those who love to bring their fur babies along.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Endor Labs is an Equal Opportunity Employer.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. Even if you don&#39;t fit every requirement above, we believe in the power of diverse perspectives and experiences, so we encourage all talented individuals to apply—there&#39;s no one-size-fits-all here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4857&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Compensation: &lt;/strong&gt;For candidates who receive an offer for this position, the compensation range is expected to be between $190,000 - $250,000. This may include additional incentives such as commission targets, restricted stock units, and/or bonuses, depending on the role.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about the role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are a diverse team of 40+ healthcare communications specialists who thrive on curiosity, the thrill of a challenge, good old-fashioned fun and working in partnership with clients to improve the health of the world, one brilliant idea at a time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We deliver global, EMEA and UK integrated marketing communications solutions for many of the world’s leading healthcare companies. Our breadth of work is limitless, as we challenge ourselves to innovate in all that we do and really make a difference. If it’s led by solid-insight or data, nothing is out of reach; from traditional media campaigns, data communications and brand launches, to multi-channel digital and social media programmes, to influencer campaigns and disease awareness initiatives, to patient apps or patient advocacy partnerships, to multi-award-winning corporate re-positioning videos and crisis management, the list is endless.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are very proud to have been awarded the EMEA Healthcare Consultancy of the Year for a few years running, as well as having received awards across the board in Social Media, PR, Marketing, Innovation, Digital and Influencer categories – an accolade to be proud of when pitted against some of the best consumer campaigns from less-regulated industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that working here is a chance to change lives, including your own. We’re a super supportive team with a warm, friendly and social culture. Through our solid PDP process and ongoing training and support, we pride ourselves on nurturing our people to be their very best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our London Office&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Burson employs over 450 people in the UK, and our stunning Southwark offices run over two floors as part of the larger WPP Campus, Rose Court. We have access to a beautiful roof terrace with panoramic views across London and a bar/restaurant area, which is a great spot for client meetings and socialising with the wider agency and other WPP OpCo’s.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;62&quot; data-end=&quot;137&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;64&quot; data-end=&quot;137&quot;&gt;Bring enthusiasm for the intersection of communications and healthcare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;138&quot; data-end=&quot;196&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;140&quot; data-end=&quot;196&quot;&gt;Join a dynamic, fast-paced team environment at Burson.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;197&quot; data-end=&quot;274&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;274&quot;&gt;Start your career strong as an Account Executive with structured support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;275&quot; data-end=&quot;353&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;277&quot; data-end=&quot;353&quot;&gt;Assist with essential account administration for client and team projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;354&quot; data-end=&quot;418&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;356&quot; data-end=&quot;418&quot;&gt;Learn on the job under the guidance of experienced managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;419&quot; data-end=&quot;486&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;486&quot;&gt;Stay updated on industry news and understand its client impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;487&quot; data-end=&quot;543&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;489&quot; data-end=&quot;543&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Show a strong interest in healthcare and media trends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that contributes to success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;51&quot; data-end=&quot;143&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;53&quot; data-end=&quot;143&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;53&quot; data-end=&quot;74&quot;&gt;Team Contribution&lt;/strong&gt;: Show a can-do attitude, flexibility, and eagerness to contribute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;144&quot; data-end=&quot;246&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;146&quot; data-end=&quot;246&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;146&quot; data-end=&quot;172&quot;&gt;Account Administration&lt;/strong&gt;: Deliver high-quality, proactive support to improve account efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;247&quot; data-end=&quot;333&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;249&quot; data-end=&quot;333&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;249&quot; data-end=&quot;270&quot;&gt;Programme Support&lt;/strong&gt;: Take ownership of specific tasks to aid campaign execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;334&quot; data-end=&quot;414&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;336&quot; data-end=&quot;414&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;336&quot; data-end=&quot;358&quot;&gt;Skills Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Build core PR and integrated marketing competencies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;415&quot; data-end=&quot;500&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;417&quot; data-end=&quot;500&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;417&quot; data-end=&quot;437&quot;&gt;Media Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Support media outreach and response activities effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;501&quot; data-end=&quot;599&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;503&quot; data-end=&quot;599&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;503&quot; data-end=&quot;520&quot;&gt;Digital Media&lt;/strong&gt;: Develop knowledge of digital and social media tools to enhance client work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;600&quot; data-end=&quot;698&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;602&quot; data-end=&quot;698&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;602&quot; data-end=&quot;615&quot;&gt;Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;: Provide accurate, timely reporting to document and communicate client activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;699&quot; data-end=&quot;850&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;701&quot; data-end=&quot;850&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;701&quot; data-end=&quot;734&quot;&gt;Research &amp;amp; Content Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Manage client materials efficiently and conduct strong desk research to support proposals and media opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-NE1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role: Head of Brands &amp;amp; Global Campaigns&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to: Brand Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand: Myprotein / Myvitamins&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Reports: 5&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: THG ICON 1, 7-9 Sunbank Lane, WA15 0AF (Fully Office Based)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About the Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting opportunity to join the Brand team at a pivotal time for both Myprotein and Myvitamins. Reporting directly to the Brand Director, you&#39;ll play a key role in bringing our brand strategy to life through best-in-class, integrated global campaigns that drive brand awareness, customer engagement and commercial growth across our international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of Brand &amp;amp; Global Campaigns, you&#39;ll lead the planning and delivery of our annual global campaign calendar, owning the development of high-impact, insight-led campaigns across both brands. This is a campaign-heavy leadership role, responsible for ensuring our biggest global brand moments are delivered consistently across every customer touchpoint, while maintaining creative excellence and commercial focus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work cross-functionally with Creative, Social, Influencer, PR, CRM, Media, Product Marketing, Commercial and Regional Marketing teams to deliver integrated global campaigns that strengthen our brand positioning and support business objectives. Alongside campaign delivery, you&#39;ll lead and develop a high-performing Brand &amp;amp; Campaigns team, embedding best practice and continually raising the standard of brand execution across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Responsible For:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the development and execution of integrated 360° global brand campaigns across Myprotein and Myvitamins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the annual global campaign calendar, ensuring key launches, innovation moments and seasonal activations are delivered on time and to the highest standard across all markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translating brand strategy into compelling global campaign plans that build brand equity while supporting commercial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with the Brand Director to evolve and execute the long-term global brand vision across both brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with Creative, Social, Influencer, PR, CRM, Paid Media, Product Marketing, Commercial and Regional Marketing teams to ensure campaigns are fully integrated across every channel and market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Championing creative excellence throughout campaign development, ensuring consistency of messaging, visual identity and execution across all customer touchpoints globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using customer insights, market trends and campaign performance to continually optimise future campaigns and identify opportunities for innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing campaign budgets, timelines and resource planning to ensure efficient delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building strong relationships with senior stakeholders across the business, influencing decision-making and aligning teams behind shared global campaign objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading, coaching and developing a high-performing Brand &amp;amp; Campaigns team, fostering collaboration, accountability and continuous development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in brand and integrated global campaign marketing, ideally within a global consumer, retail, lifestyle or wellness business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience developing and delivering large-scale, multi-channel global campaigns that deliver measurable brand and commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of brand strategy and how to translate it into engaging, customer-first global campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing high-performing marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills with the ability to influence at all levels of the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commercially minded approach, balancing creativity with business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational and project management skills, with experience managing multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence using consumer insights and campaign data to inform decisions and optimise future activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for building globally recognised brands and creating campaigns that customers genuinely connect with.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
