&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why be a Graduate Data &amp;amp; Insight Analyst at THG?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Graduate Data &amp;amp; Insight Analyst, you will support the delivery of consumer and market insight across THG’s Beauty and Nutrition divisions. This is an entry-level role for a curious, analytically minded graduate who wants to build a career in insight and market research. You will work closely with the Insight Manager and Insight Lead to learn research methodology, develop your analytical skills and contribute to insight that informs senior decisions across the group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support delivery of primary and secondary research projects — data collection, coding, analysis and report preparation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and update brand tracking, NPS and consumer panel datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research competitors, market trends and consumer behaviour — collating and summarising findings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare slides, reports and briefing documents to support Insight Manager and Insight Lead outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse survey data and quantitative research outputs — producing clear summaries and basic visualisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the maintenance of insight databases and knowledge libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out desk research — sourcing market reports, industry data and competitor intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Contribution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute reliably to team projects — meeting deadlines and flagging issues early&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn from the Insight Manager and Insight Lead — asking good questions and applying feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build working knowledge of research methodology, the beauty and nutrition sectors, and THG’s consumer base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What skills and experience do I need for this role?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate or equivalent with a degree in a relevant discipline — market research, social science, business, psychology, data science or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity about consumer behaviour and market dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical thinking — able to work with data and draw clear conclusions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written communication — able to summarise findings clearly and concisely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and reliable — able to manage multiple tasks and meet deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior exposure to market research, consumer insight or analytics — internship, placement or project work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with survey tools or data analysis software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in beauty, wellness, nutrition or e-commerce sectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic Excel or data skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
