&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, expert-level experience with BigQuery and GCP — this is non-negotiable; you must have built and operated production data pipelines on this stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python skills — used daily for pipeline development, data transformation and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across at least two of the three core data domains: Customer, Commercial and Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of evolving data architecture — you can demonstrate concrete examples of how you changed the way a business structures, stores or consumes its data&lt;/li&gt;
