&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain data pipelines in the Customer domain under the direction of the Senior Data Engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, well-documented SQL and Python code that meets the team’s standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the monitoring and resolution of pipeline issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to data quality checks and validation in the Customer domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop your understanding of the Customer data domain — CRM, acquisition, identity and marketing data flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and apply engineering best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take on increasing responsibility over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with both Data Engineers and the Senior Data Engineer in the Customer team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support analytics teams with data requests and pipeline queries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
